{
  "title": "Warm Comforting American Corn Casserole",
  "description": "A resinous, pillowy, comforting American dish featuring extra clotted cream, mantecare emulsify, and satvik-friendly ingredients, perfect for a cold winter evening.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "diet": [
